Core principle

Split by runtime responsibility, not by “feature names.”

Good split
	•	orchestration
	•	governed IO
	•	ingestion
	•	KG
	•	vector
	•	UI
	•	ontology
	•	infra
	•	contracts
Bad split

During refactor, tell them:
	•	Move workflow logic into graphs/ and nodes/
	•	Move all direct datastore access out of nodes and into MCP tools
	•	Move prompts out of code and into versioned prompt files
	•	Move event schemas into a separate contracts repo
	•	Keep ontology outside runtime services






